# Zots run 2

Joel asked for another run at Zots on 2026-08-19, inside the CYC26 talk repo.

Run 1 was the course bible: just-bash as the game engine, a full lexicon, colony sim, Vercel Academy draft. That is not this repo.

Run 2 is a playable slice on the talk floor.

## What shipped

- `the-claw look` — this repo is the dungeon. Only named chambers print. `node_modules` is The Deep Warren.
- `the-claw summon --role scout|executor|critic`
- `the-claw toil` — one tick. Life force drops. Mood hops one state.
- `the-claw colony`

Mood is an XState machine. A zot cannot skip from healthy to spiraling in one tick. That is the Cascadia line in miniature: think in states.

No model. No just-bash. No course dump. Deterministic so it works on stage.

## Why this cut

The first run died of cathedral. This run has to survive a 25-minute room and `pnpm check`.

The joke is still the design: minions of toil take the shortest path. The fence is why `--no-verify` becomes a confused executor, not a green commit.

A later cut can grow a Life field: local rules, a tick journal, replay. That is not this slice. Do not put a model in every cell.
